  "id": "t4-nash-v1",
  "mechanism_class": "structural",
  "mechanism_rationale": "Parameter-space optimizers (Adam, SGD) step in ||Delta theta|| whereas the GAN minimax game lives in pushforward/potential function space (Delta G(z), Delta D(x)). Under severe G/D capacity or LR asymmetry (>600x parameter mismatch in either D>>G or G>>D direction, or 10:1 / 1:10 LR ratios) and hostile non-complementary initialization (~-30 step-0 logit margin with compressed/amplified off-manifold G), overpowered critics saturate before G moves while underpowered critics let G collapse onto stale peaks. T4Nash matches physical function-space step impedance for both players in O(params)+O(B) work with zero SVD calls.",
